Galaxy A51 (SM-A515F, Exynos 9611) board layer, on top of 0124.

Flips the board selector from DREAMLTE to A51, adds the measured A51 board
block, and extends the DREAMLTE guards that are board-neutral so the A51 gets
the ramoops console copy (pexpert/arm/pe_serial.c), the framebuffer VA
reservation and deterministic physmap (osfmk/arm64/arm_vm_init.c), the CPU_ON
trampoline for a high-bank entry (iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetCPU.cpp) and the
frame-done wait before each copy (iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp, with
the A51 DECON base).

Deliberately NOT extended: the S8 MPIDR topology (A51 measured A53 = MPIDR
0x0-0x3 as the boot cluster, which is the existing A5XELTE branch), the S8
logical display size (A51 presents its native 1080x2400), the S6SY761 touch
driver (A51 has a Melfas MMS100) and the S8 key sampling (A51 ALIVE pinctrl is
0x11850000 with the keys on banks 5/6/7 pin 15; A5_KEYS_DEFAULT is 0 until that
is written).

All values measured on hardware by shim/a51; see A51_PROGRESS.md for the boot
log and the evidence for each one: framebuffer 0xca000000 1080x2400 stride 4320
(dpp@0x14881000 IN_BASE_ADDR_Y), DECON_F 0x148b0000 in command mode, GICD
0x12301000 / GICC 0x12302000 disabled at handoff, 26 MHz physical timer (INTID
30), UFSHCI 2.1 at 0x13520000 with userdata at LBA 0x1f7500, and the log channel
is the ramoops pmsg zone 0xf9e90000 -> /sys/fs/pstore/pmsg-ramoops-0.

diff --git a/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/A5XELTE.h b/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/A5XELTE.h
--- a/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/A5XELTE.h
+++ b/pexpert/pexpert/arm64/A5XELTE.h
@@ -25,12 +25,42 @@
 #define A5XELTE_VTIMER_INTID         27
 
 /*
- * Samsung Galaxy S8 (SM-G950F, dreamlte, Exynos 8895) build of this port.
- * Same Samsung S-Boot handoff, GIC-400, 26 MHz timer and Cortex-A53 boot
- * cluster as the A5; the board facts that differ are below.
- */
-#define DREAMLTE                      1
-#if defined(DREAMLTE)
+ * Samsung Galaxy A51 (SM-A515F, a51, Exynos 9611) build of this port.
+ * Same Samsung S-Boot handoff, GIC-400, 26 MHz timer and Cortex-A53 boot
+ * cluster as the A5; the board facts that differ are below.
+ */
+#define A51                           1
+#if defined(A51)
+/*
+ * Samsung Galaxy A51 (SM-A515F, a51, Exynos 9611). Measured on hardware by
+ * shim/a51 on 2026-10-27: S-Boot hands off at EL1 with the MMU off
+ * (SCTLR_EL1 0x30c5083a) on MPIDR 0 (Cortex-A53 little cluster), no EL2/EL3
+ * (ID_AA64PFR0_EL1 0x2222), 40-bit PA (ID_AA64MMFR0_EL1 0x1122), CNTFRQ_EL0
+ * already 26 MHz, GICD 0x12301000 present but disabled (GICD_CTLR 0),
+ * DECON_F 0x148b0000 running in command mode (GLOBAL_CONTROL 0x113) and
+ * still scanning 0xca000000 through dpp@0x14881000 (IN_BASE_ADDR_Y, with
+ * SRC_SIZE/IMG_SIZE 0x09600438 = 2400x1080). The panel needs no DECON
+ * programming to show framebuffer writes: 1901 FRAME_DONE events in 25 s.
+ */
+#define A5_FB_PHYS                    0xca000000  /* s3cfb.bootloaderfb, confirmed */
+#define A5_FB_WIDTH                   1080
+#define A5_FB_HEIGHT                  2400
+#define A5_FB_STRIDE                  4320        /* bytes per row, XRGB8888 */
+#define A5_FB_2M_BLOCKS               5           /* 1080*2400*4 = 10368000 */
+#define A5_DECON_PHYS                 0x148b0000  /* DECON_F, not the S8 0x12860000 */
+#define A5_ENTRY_MARKER_PHYS          0xf9e90010  /* pmsg zone data + 4: 8-byte aligned (MMU-off Device store) */
+#define A5_BOOT_MPIDR                 0x0         /* A53 little cluster boots */
+#define A5_KEYS_DEFAULT               0           /* ALIVE is 0x11850000 on 9611, banks 5/6/7 pin 15; Phase 5 */
+#define A5_TOUCH_DEFAULT              0           /* Melfas MMS100 on i2c 0x48: no driver yet */
+#define A5_KLOG_PHYS                  0xf9e90000  /* ramoops PMSG zone, not the dump zone */
+#define A5_KLOG_SIZE                  0x80000     /* pmsg_size = SZ_512K */
+/* The live /timer node carries "use-physical-timer" like the S8, so arm the
+ * non-secure physical timer: PPI 14 = INTID 30. a5xelte uses 27 (virtual)
+ * only because the Exynos7580 DT lacks that property. */
+#define A5_USE_PHYS_TIMER             1
+#undef A5XELTE_VTIMER_INTID
+#define A5XELTE_VTIMER_INTID         30
+#elif defined(DREAMLTE)
 #define A5_FB_PHYS                    0xcc000000  /* s3cfb.bootloaderfb */
 #define A5_FB_WIDTH                   1440
 #define A5_FB_HEIGHT                  2960
